      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Specimen&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; : Bone Marrow</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Instrument software&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: BD FACS LYRIC/BD FACS SUITE</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Gating strategy&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 12 colour FCM using FSC vs.CD45&amp;CD38-CD138 gating</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cell preparation method&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Stain - Lyse - Wash</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Number of Events Acquired&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3000000</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">FSC SSC Viable events&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2830611</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Total plasma cells,% of viable cells&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;1.52&nbsp; &nbsp;%</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">NPC,% of all plasma cells&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:&nbsp;56.7012&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;%</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">(Normal plasma cells)</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">APC,% of all plasma cells&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:&nbsp;&nbsp;43.2988&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; %</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">(Abnormal plasma cells)</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">APC,% of viable cells&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; :&nbsp; 0.6586&nbsp; &nbsp; %</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Descriptive Summary:- The flow cytometry examination of bone marrow was done. A total of 30 lac events were acquired.<br>The analysis shows a cluster of abnormal&nbsp;plasma cells 0.6586% of all viable gated cells.</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">These normal plasma cells show moderate heterogenous CD45, moderate CD38, moderate to bright CD138, moderate to bright CD56, moderate to bright CD319, dim to negative CD27, heterogenous CD81, dim heterogenous CD117, moderate heterogenous cytoplasmic kappa light chain expression. These cells are negative for CD19 and lambda light chain.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>IMPRESSION&nbsp;:&nbsp;Flow cytometry analysis shows 0.658% abnormal&nbsp;plasma cells.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Kindly correlate with Serum protein lectrophoresis, biochemical parameters and radiological details.</strong></span></p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
